'''Otta-smack-u''' (フルぼっこ, ''Furubokko'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Into the Future]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Legend Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

