==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Otta-smack-u
|Dark Otter
|A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of Otta-smack-u, with much higher overall stats, but slower movement speed and 2 knockbacks.
|Festive Otter
|An event variant of Otta-smack-u first seen in [[Summer Break Cats|Summer Diary]]. Deals higher damage and has 4x more HP with 2 knockbacks, as well as a 50% chance to knockback cats.
|CTO Seal
|A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of Otta-smack-u introduced in the [[Worker's Revolution (Monthly Event)|Worker's Revolution]] event. It has a 100% chance of [[freeze|freezing]] cats and has much higher range (380), allowing it to outrange [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]].
|Lutrinae Gokurakko
|An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of Otta-smack-u with extremely magnified stats, 3 knockbacks, Omni Strikes that have a 50% chance to knock units back, and [[Counter-Surge]]. It still has a low cash drop for its difficulty.
|South Seas Otter
|An Otta-smack-u variant from [[Island Defenders!]]. Guaranteed to slow units for 3 seconds and has 300 range, 3 knockbacks and a 30% chance to create a level 3 [[Mini-Surge]] at 300~500.
}}

