==Trivia==
*"Otta-smack-u" is a play on the phrase "oughta smack you" and the word ''otter''.
*''Furubokko'' is a Japanese slang term meaning "absolute beating".
*Every Otta-smack-u variant's Japanese name ends in ''-kko'' (っこ or ッコ). In English, only [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]] follows this naming scheme.

